        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="ECfRetr_34-3.lnote.la.fn.i" n="i" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">663</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de"><hi rend="italic">den Retr. beeinflusst vielleicht Will. Malm.</hi> Reg. II 183: Cnut leges ab antiquis regibus, et maxime Ethelredo, latas obseruari precepit, in quarum custodiam etiam nunc sub nomine regis Edwardi iuratur, non quod ille statuerit, sed quod obseruarit</seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">the Retr. is perhaps influenced by Will. Malm., Reg. II 183: Cnut leges ab antiquis regibus, et maxime Ethelredo, latas obseruari precepit, in quarum custodiam etiam nunc sub nomine regis Edwardi iuratur, non quod ille statuerit, sed quod obseruarit</seg></note>
